            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 32:33",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 33
      },
      {
        "text": "And the children of Gad built Dibon, and Ataroth, and Aroer,",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "OR rebuilt."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 34,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 32:34",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 34
      },
      {
        "text": "And Atroth, Shophan, and Jaazer, and Jogbehah,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 35,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 32:35",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 35
      },
      {
        "text": "And Beth-nimrah, and Beth-haran, fenced cities: and folds for sheep.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 39,
            "text": "HEB fortified."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 36,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 32:36",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 36
      },
      {
        "text": "And the children of Reuben built Heshbon, and Elealeh, and Kirjathaim,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 37,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 32:37",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 37
      },
      {
        "text": "And Nebo, and Baal-meon, (their names being changed,) and Shibmah: and gave other names unto the cities which they builded.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 38,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 32:38",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 38
      },
      {
